---
// ResearchInterests.astro
---

<div class="research-box">
  <span class="research-label">Research Interests</span>
  <p class="research-text">
    AI Security · Cyber Threat Intelligence · Mobile Network Security (5G/6G) · IoT/Edge and Smart
    Infrastructure Security · Anomaly Detection · Protection of large-scale distributed and autonomous systems.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .research-box {
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 13px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--accent-border);
    background: var(--accent-bg);
  }

  .research-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .research-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
</style>